From: CesareFI <236205415+CesareFI@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 13:00:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve remaining S3 strings with bounded copies on current
 main

Copy recipe entries with their exact allocated byte count, including NUL.
Carry actual capacity in the LRU test collector and check each formatting
result in the fixture builders. Preserve all fixture contents, spacing,
ordering, random draws, allocation failures and existing expectations.

Keep the upstream zxml fix. Regenerate the four retired hardening rows
and the affected package registry declaration with supported generators;
no archived metadata or dependency pins are copied.

Owner-relayed Rhett assignment; native coordination currently unavailable.
This is an independent review candidate, not qualified for landing.

Co-Authored-By: Codex (GPT-6) <noreply@openai.com>
